WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Makikawa, you’re not dead

2
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:07,530
Why? The former shopkeeper is very disappointed. It's impossible.

3
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:11,410
How could you not move to death? Come here.

4
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:13,210
It’s not just to see if I’m dead, right?

5
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:18,260
I brought what I wanted

6
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:19,660
You're lucky, kid

7
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:21,060
stone coal crane coal

8
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,060
I brought it all to you

9
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:25,260
Yesterday you only gave me room and earth energy. You can hide it, right?

10
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:30,040
Okay, okay from now on

11
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,440
The Mu family’s house and land

12
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:35,840
But it’s all mine. This cart of stuff is also mine.

13
00:00:36,040 --> 00:00:37,640
Burn as much as you like, burn as much as you like

14
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:39,440
Just don't blame me for not reminding you

15
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,840
Burn these poisonous stones

16
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,240
Can smoke a living person to death

17
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:43,440
Didn't move to death last night

18
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,640
Don't wait for two days

19
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:50,600
Died again on this pile of broken rocks, uncle
